## Why This Is Asked
Tests real-world concerns: consent governance, dynamic schema evolution, cross-region data lineage, residency, and auditable privacy controls.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant consent governance and field-level filtering
- Edge filtering and region-local routing
- Schema evolution via Avro + schema registry with versioning
- Tamper-evident, immutable audit logs for lineage
- DSAR testing, data portability, and deletion guarantees

## Code Example
```javascript
function filterFieldsByConsent(event, consentMap) {
  const allowed = consentMap[event.tenant_id] || [];
  const filtered = {};
  for (const k of Object.keys(event)) {
    if (allowed.includes(k)) filtered[k] = event[k];
  }
  return filtered;
}
```

